=2 Walkthrough
>**{c=red:Warning:}** **{p:Trust Magic} CANNOT be used in this BCNM.**
!Ifrit's Cauldron-map1.jpg|right|Map A
!Ifrit's Cauldron-map2.jpg|right|Map B
!Ifrit's Cauldron-map7.jpg|right|Map C
* Speak with {n:Ronta-Onta} to obtain quest. If you are positive that you have the required fame but he is not allowing you to undertake this quest, continue speaking with him until his text changes. Once you have received the {p:key item|Key item}: {@k} {k:Tuning fork of fire}, you can now safely undertake the quest.

* Travel to {z:Yhoator Jungle} and look for the entrance to {z:Ifrit's Cauldron} at (I-6). On the first map of {z:Ifrit's Cauldron} head to the **Flame Spout** at (H-6). Trade it an {@i:Ice Cluster|4105} {i:Ice Cluster|Ice Cluster|4105} to make it recede or wait for it to recede on its own, then continue to (F-6). On the second map (Map B), go to (I-8) to drop down to the seventh map. When you land (Map C) go to the drop at (H-7), then proceed to (G-6) to find the entrance to the {z:Cloister of Flames}.
** Preferably, home point to {z:Ifrit's Cauldron} #1. If you don't have it yet, make sure to grab it on the way.
** The Unity 125 warp places you within a short run to the home point. Go left to J follow the tunnel and walk off the ledge at the end of it (the north part of the middle area).
* Defeat {m:Ifrit Prime} and you will receive a {p:key item|Key item}: {@k} {k:Whisper of flames}
* Return to {n:Ronta-Onta} with the whisper and he will provide several reward options including the ability to summon {p:Ifrit (Avatar)}.

=2 Notes
* Up to 6 party members can enter the arena.
* Each party member must have their own {@k} {k:Tuning fork of fire}.
* Time limit is 30 minutes.
* You can only select **one** of the rewards {n:Ronta-Onta} offers at any time.
* You may repeat this quest once per Earth day.
* You can save yourself a lot of time traveling to the Cloister by using the {@i:Mini Fork of Fire|1544} {i:Mini Fork of Fire|Mini Fork of Fire|1544} given by the quest {q:Trial-Size Trial by Fire|Trial-Size Trial by Fire|Trial-Size Trial by Fire}. You must be on {p:Summoner} as your main job, and obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from {n:Dodmos}, trade the fork back to {n:Dodmos}, but enter the Protocrystal normally. So long as you do not clear the level 20 version of the BC, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you wish. (...or you can use {p:Home Point} warps, because it's the future.)
* You may also choose to retain the whisper in order to complete the requirements for this quest: {q:The Moonlit Path|The Moonlit Path|The Moonlit Path}.

